121	+      | anon1       | anon1@example.com | email           | false   |
122	+    Then a user logged in space s2 should get these identifier write results:
123	+      | operation | account | result |
124	+      | insert    | anon1   | denied |
125	+      | update    | anon1   | denied |
126	+      | delete    | anon1   | denied |
127	+    And a user logged in space s2 should get these account write results:
